    {
      "text": "he who is faithful in keeping commandments will be lifted up at last day, D&C 5:35 (9:14; 17:8; 52:43–44; 75:16, 22). stand fast in work and you shall be lifted up, D&C 9:14. I have lifted thee out of thine afflictions, D&C 24:1. lift up thy heart and rejoice, D&C 25:13 (27:15; 31:3; 35:26). Christ will lift up faithful, D&C 52:44. lift up hands that hang down, D&C 81:5. first lift standard of peace unto those who proclaim war, D&C 98:34. those who impart not to poor will lift up eyes in hell, D&C 104:18. Gentiles to come to exaltation or lifting up of Zion, D&C 124:9.",
